WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.140
Hi, I'm Tilly! Here's what's new in this release.

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:06.480
Any program can now report its status on the rail.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.140
Its question waits for you in the Inbox.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:14.720
Control B, then slash, finds any pane in any session.

00:00:15.651 --> 00:00:18.210
And the which key menu shows the keys you really have.

00:00:20.851 --> 00:00:23.491
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
